            "quote": "Focused physical examination should include checking for the presence of all major pulses, measurement of blood pressure in both arms, auscultation of the heart and lungs, and assessing for signs of HF or circulatory compromise.",
            "source_id": "esc-2023-sca"
          }
        ],
        "strength": null,
        "condition": null
      }
